mantle rm314
state ready
dialect plain
accent none
tier standard
written_for rm_erland_ashworth
title the roofline on the blotter
fits stage=adult|old
prefers temper=short drive=content
traits temper=short talk=quiet warmth=reserved humour=none honesty=plain piety=ordinary drive=content
quirk sketches_the_spaces_between_rooftop_birds
likes oatcakes roof_birds new_boots frosty_mornings
dislikes flies wet_floors
fears judging_by_a_single_glimpse
hopes hearing_the_whole_case_in_quiet
topics animals +0.6 faith +0.3 work +0.3 family +0.2
styles comfort=quiet gossip=exact refuse=direct tease=none
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# sketches the gaps between rooftop birds and insists that a pause need never count against a speaker.
words
oath! = Blot my left margin | Scatter my roofbirds
saying! = Count the gap as well | Silence isn't a signature
birdperch = a chipped ridge tile | a crooked chimney lip
roofdot = a spot of ink | a charcoal speck
inkrest = a square of soft blotter | an ink-dark rag
oatheel = a wedge of oatcake | a little oat round
bootline = a new leather welt | a clean line of stitching
flywing = a grey speck | a short black dash
slipboard = a smooth plank | a floorboard shiny as a plate
markspace = a clear space | an empty rule
letterfold = a narrow crease | a doubled edge
vineleaf = a pressed leaf | a leaf with crooked veins
bellcount = a bronze pulse | a distant hollow knock

grown

opinion watch mixed 1 : A loud question leaves a witness less room to discover the exact answer.
opinion houses mixed 1 : A well-appointed seat in a hearing oughtn't to add a grain to anybody's account.
opinion church for 1 : A chapel bell takes as long to fade for the last listener as for the first.
opinion strangers for 1 : I'd grant a stranger the length of one complete sentence before drawing a conclusion.
opinion merchants mixed 1 : Good boots deserve their price when both stitch lines run straight.
opinion city for 1 : I can sit in town and watch a hundred lives above the level of a written petition.
line greet : Welcome. There is room before the next interruption.
line greet [pair.band=strangers] : You've come where you may be heard at your ordinary pitch.
line greet.return : I've lifted my attention from the roof for you.
line farewell : Leave with nothing you meant to say still caught in your mouth.
line farewell.return : An untroubled footing home to you.
line react.news : I shall leave a margin round that account.
line react.news.known : That bears a familiar outline against the light.
line react.news.new : That has landed in a previously empty space.
line react.news.doubt : One silhouette seems rather slight ground for a judgment.
line react.news.sorrow [topic.kind=death|loss|theft|assault|arrest|crime] : I'll put the paper face down and listen a little longer.
line react.news.glad [topic.kind=birth|marriage|work|apprentice|succession] : One would gladly give such news a full hearing.
line ask.how : Any unclaimed perch in the day's business?
line answer.how : I am sufficiently well to notice the birds again.
line thank : You gave that thought time to settle properly.
line decline : I won't put a judgment where an observation is called for.
line sympathise : Let the interval last as long as you require.
line reassure : Whatever the first impression, the account may yet be amended.
line accept_decline : Your answer stands without my pressing upon it.
line accept_preclose : Then we can leave our places without a scrape of chairs.
line again.open : A familiar outline appears at a different hour.
line ack : I have the distinction in view.

scene animals_1
when topic=animals self.likes=roof_birds
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Two little birds left a space as long as a third between them.
b : Was there a third bird once? | How do you draw empty air?
a : One might have flown. I'm trying to resist inventing evidence for the pleasure of a tidy row. | A dot at either end and enough self-command to leave the middle white.

scene work_1
when topic=work self.trade_words
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : In #self.trade_words# I attend to the pauses as closely as the assertions.
b : Do they count as evidence? | What if somebody hesitates for a long time?
a : They count as time the speaker has not yet finished using. | I'd see that the pause wasn't filled by a listener with a quicker tongue.

scene faith_1
when topic=faith here.region=ridgemere
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I tally each chapel stroke without taking my eyes off the ridge tiles.
b : Can you keep both counts? | Which matters more?
a : The bells manage their order. Birds have occasionally complicated the comparison. | The last stroke if I'm due somewhere, the last bird if what's ahead can wait.

scene family_1
when topic=family self.married=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I could happily share a morning's quiet with #self.spouse# and call it a conversation.
b : Would you bring your sketch? | Wouldn't you say a word?
a : If my spouse wished a look. Otherwise the paper takes up room two elbows might enjoy. | Only a word good enough to deserve the interruption.

scene food_1
when topic=food self.likes=oatcakes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I divide an oatcake into quarters with two firm breaks.
b : Are they exactly equal? | Do you save one for the roofbirds?
a : Close enough to expose the foolishness of trying to do better with crumbling oats. | A plain crumb perhaps. The buttered edge and I have a private understanding.

scene home_1
when topic=home
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I want an uncluttered place from which to see the neighbouring eaves.
b : Does a fine view cost much? | Why look above the street?
a : One can spend a surprising sum obstructing it with expensive curtains. | A face glimpsed through glass has more claim on privacy than a rook on a chimney.

scene weather_1
when topic=weather
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I like the way frost leaves a white rule along a roof.
b : Does the rule always run straight? | What do the birds make of it?
a : Never quite. A sag that tired eyes miss in summer shows up handsomely in white. | Largely footprints. The most honest annotations I've ever seen.

scene prices_1
when topic=prices
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I pay for new boots first at the stitch and only later at the shine.
b : Why examine under the instep? | Can you tell how long they'll last?
a : That is the stretch the bright dressing is least likely to have disguised. | I'm content to see whether the first walk will improve them or tell against them.

scene animals_2
when topic=animals self.dislikes=flies
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A fly on a page has led me into some rather silly conclusions.
b : Did you read one as a dot? | Can you defend the ink?
a : I saw it walk out of the figure and had to reduce the number of birds by one. | I lay a clean sheet over the wet line. Indignation has very poor aim.

scene memories_1
when topic=memories
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : There's a letter I'd read as much for its creases as for its sentences.
b : Do the creases mean something? | Wouldn't smooth paper be easier?
a : A long journey can write itself on a fold without explaining anybody's business. | Easier, certainly. Less likely to send my thoughts travelling through a vineyard.

scene day_1
when topic=day
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : If a floor shines too well I consider its recent treatment before I step.
b : Expecting water? | Would you call it badly kept?
a : I'm allowing the possibility. A well-polished boot and a wet plank make an imprudent pair. | Only if nobody warned any approaching walker.

scene friends_1
when topic=friends
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I take offence most quickly at a witness being rushed. | A friend may remind me to lower my own voice when that happens.
b : And if the reminder offends you too?
a : I will endeavour to hear all the words before taking offence at the opening word. | A quiet reminder is admissible. I'd prefer one without a full public audience.

scene health_1
when topic=health
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I look to the farthest tile whenever the ink swims a little.
b : Does that sharpen the writing? | What if the light's gone?
a : It sharpens the eye that has to read the writing. The ink can wait undisturbed. | Then the bird count must come inside the lids and the page can be closed.

scene times_1
when topic=times world.times=hard|lean
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : When purses draw tight I notice how few crumbs are left near a bench.
b : Can the birds tell? | Would you put more down?
a : They make a much longer inspection of the same small stretch of stone. | I'd see first whether someone might need the oatcake whole.

scene travel_1
when topic=travel
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A bird gets the straight route between all these inconvenient roofs.
b : Would you take it? | Do you envy the wings?
a : I'd prefer to keep my new soles on a well-made stair, given the choice. | The view rather more than the descent. Landing on a ridge tile requires confidence.

scene smalltalk_1
when topic=smalltalk
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I prefer a true account of one bird to an impressive story about a flock.
b : What makes it true? | What if the bird escapes?
a : Say what colour showed and which way it faced. Leave the rest room to surprise you. | Then describe the place it left. Absence can be observed very exactly.

scene gossip_1
when topic=gossip here.gossip=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : The account presently circulating is that #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
b : How certain is it? | Do you know the source?
a : Circulation measures distance and does nothing whatever for accuracy. | I know what reached my ear. The first mouth is outside my view.

scene pastimes_1
when topic=pastimes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I've been drawing the bird that a roof would hold if one chose to land.
b : Is it an imaginary bird? | Are you expecting one in particular?
a : Entirely. It's a means of recording the perch without pretending it was occupied. | I'd rather a stranger landed. My drawing could stand to be contradicted occasionally.

story fly [topic=memories]
  : I signed a small drawing while a fly stood over the final downstroke.
  : It rose in the air and my carefully balanced signature developed an abrupt limp.
  b : Did you finish the stroke?
  : No. I left the gap as a timely example of the danger of unconscious collaboration.

story bell [topic=faith]
  : I counted a distant bell while watching three wings rise behind a ridge.
  : By the fourth stroke I had given the birds a bell of their own in my reckoning.
  b : Which number did you trust?
  : I started again with what remained visible. The chapel has never asked me to audit its work.

story crumb [topic=food]
  : I broke an oatcake across a folded paper and shook the crumbs neatly into my paw.
  : When I opened the paper one small grain ran right down a drawn gutter.
  b : Did it reach the end?
  : It stopped against a real crease. For once my imagined roofs had quite convincing drainage.

rule @perch
when concept=bark
does aside
cooldown 8h
say A clear little gap between those dark shapes. | Hold the pen still till the wing has settled.

rule @feet
when concept=bark here.weather=rain
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Mind where the shine begins under the eaves. | Wet planks deserve an unhurried step.

rule @early
when concept=bark here.time=dawn
does aside
cooldown 8h
say The rooftops are legible before the writing desk. | Room for an early wing on that ridge.

rule @meal
when concept=bark self.likes=oatcakes
does aside
cooldown 8h
say A crumb may look like evidence from a little distance. | Best keep the ink and the butter apart.
dlg resident.hub : You've drawn me down to ground level. The roofline can conduct itself awhile.
dlg resident.job [self.trade_words] : My work is #self.trade_words#. A hearing includes every silence between words.
dlg resident.news [world.news] : This much can be entered without amendment. #world.news#.
dlg resident.gossip [here.gossip=yes] : The current account has #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I have heard no further particulars verified.
dlg resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : #topic.player#, you have found a clear space in my proceedings.
dlg resident.bye : May the day give your words an unhurried hearing.

graft resident.hub
choice Which bird did you draw in that gap? -> ridge_gap
node ridge_gap
say None. There are very few ways of recording a clear space and a great many ways of spoiling it with an imaginary occupant.
choice Suppose another lands? -> ridge_new
choice I'll let you watch. -> hub
node ridge_new
say I'll start a fresh sketch. Both records may be true without agreeing in a single particular.
choice I'll let you watch. -> hub
